    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/68bfd5fd10cb77712da82f0d202075c0.poster.avif?t=1755384390\" width=630 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/68bfd5fd10cb77712da82f0d202075c0.webm?t=1755384390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/68bfd5fd10cb77712da82f0d202075c0.mp4?t=1755384390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/50fd7984fe3fc1989f779938eb64f5dc.avif?t=1755384390\" width=630 height=82 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>level design</strong> crafted for fans of <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>creative gameplay</strong>, where every turn may hide a surprise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable weapons</strong> and <strong>versatile tools</strong> to both fight your enemies and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat that rewards <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>strategic planning</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 hidden talismans</strong> to collect as you work toward your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive atmosphere</strong> and <strong>carefully crafted sound</strong> <strong>design</strong> for a truly engaging experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/517cfaacbf7b64bc106edd960f5edd59.avif?t=1755384390\" width=630 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- 2 difficulty modes\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> - 2 different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- 1 Mini-Game to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> - 12/15 hours of playing time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>\u2b2a Demon Quest was developed by one person in 4 years.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/68bfd5fd10cb77712da82f0d202075c0.poster.avif?t=1755384390\" width=630 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/68bfd5fd10cb77712da82f0d202075c0.webm?t=1755384390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/68bfd5fd10cb77712da82f0d202075c0.mp4?t=1755384390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/50fd7984fe3fc1989f779938eb64f5dc.avif?t=1755384390\" width=630 height=82 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>level design</strong> crafted for fans of <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>creative gameplay</strong>, where every turn may hide a surprise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable weapons</strong> and <strong>versatile tools</strong> to both fight your enemies and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat that rewards <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>strategic planning</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 hidden talismans</strong> to collect as you work toward your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive atmosphere</strong> and <strong>carefully crafted sound</strong> <strong>design</strong> for a truly engaging experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133560/extras/517cfaacbf7b64bc106edd960f5edd59.avif?t=1755384390\" width=630 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- 2 difficulty modes\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> - 2 different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- 1 Mini-Game to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> - 12/15 hours of playing time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>\u2b2a Demon Quest was developed by one person in 4 years.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "Captive in an alien world full of secrets, solve puzzles, wield your versatile tools with ingenuity, and face your enemies with stealth and strategy. Embark on the quest for the sacred talismans\u2026 or remain a prisoner forever.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cPresented as a Metroidvania, Demon Quest is ultimately a platform/puzzle game, but a very good one at that. While its cryptic storyline and mechanics make this game a title not for everyone, it's still a very good game for anyone who wants to invest a little. While I spent about ten hours playing the game, this lifespan will depend heavily on your ability to understand its puzzles. Despite some inaccuracies in its gameplay, Demon Quest is a particularly satisfying game with its unique atmosphere and the rare satisfaction you feel when you thwart its traps. Demon Quest is a must-play for anyone who enjoyed Limbo.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 LaRevueD\u2019Geek<br>",
